{"2474430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"TetherGeist","steam_appid":2474430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4633720,4641470],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Treacherous Pilgrimage<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Mae on a coming-of-age pilgrimage in this heartfelt precision platformer, designed for both newcomers and those in search of a challenge. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hundreds of years, the Mountain Shaman have used their powers of <strong>Astral Projection<\/strong> to travel vast distances. But Mae is different – her spirit travel is limited by a tether. When the time comes for a coming of age pilgrimage, Mae must forgo spirit flight and take the journey the long way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Mae on her challenging journey, using tough but satisfying platforming to leap and bound towards her goal. Master seven different <strong>Azae<\/strong> that change how your spirit interacts with the environment. Scour the world for secrets, treasures and hidden paths – your curiosity will be rewarded!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision and depth: <\/strong>Progressively unlock seven different spirit abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek and find: <\/strong>Discover hidden secrets, alternate paths and more<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure precision platforming: <\/strong>No combat, powerups or skill trees<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A speedrunner’s dream: <\/strong>Push your skills to the limit with timed runs!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough but forgiving: <\/strong>Frequent checkpoints help you learn from your mistakes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full of heart: <\/strong>Discover a story about community, difference and growing up<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1780680329\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras_big\/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1780680329 width=800 height=119 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Treacherous Pilgrimage<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Mae on a coming-of-age pilgrimage in this heartfelt precision platformer, designed for both newcomers and those in search of a challenge. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/f4979d215dc653a9c0fdd092880af054.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hundreds of years, the Mountain Shaman have used their powers of <strong>Astral Projection<\/strong> to travel vast distances. But Mae is different – her spirit travel is limited by a tether. When the time comes for a coming of age pilgrimage, Mae must forgo spirit flight and take the journey the long way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/8cf037f4da387fc0a89fa017b272a16e.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Mae on her challenging journey, using tough but satisfying platforming to leap and bound towards her goal. Master seven different <strong>Azae<\/strong> that change how your spirit interacts with the environment. Scour the world for secrets, treasures and hidden paths – your curiosity will be rewarded!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.poster.avif?t=1780680329\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.webm?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/2ed7c8ca71f8d51519eb68d01f955d16.mp4?t=1780680329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision and depth: <\/strong>Progressively unlock seven different spirit abilities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek and find: <\/strong>Discover hidden secrets, alternate paths and more<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure precision platforming: <\/strong>No combat, powerups or skill trees<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A speedrunner’s dream: <\/strong>Push your skills to the limit with timed runs!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough but forgiving: <\/strong>Frequent checkpoints help you learn from your mistakes<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full of heart: <\/strong>Discover a story about community, difference and growing up<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras\/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1780680329\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/extras_big\/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1780680329 width=800 height=119 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"TetherGeist is a challenging precision platformer that rewards practice and perseverance. Guide Mae and her axolotl spirit, Bao, on a wholesome coming-of-age pilgrimage while mastering Astral Projection, a tether that links Mae to her spirit and is the source of her strength.","supported_languages":"English, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","reviews":"“There's a simple joy in TetherGeist. The easy levels let you appreciate the clever game design, while the more difficult levels reward you with the sheer, blissful satisfaction of finally conquering that mountain.”<br>TechRaptor<br><br>“The best precision platformer I've played since Celeste, with some seriously unique movement mechanics and perfect controls.”<br>Loot Level Chill<br><br>“I died 2500 times and kept coming back for more, TetherGeist is that good.”<br>VDGMS<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2474430\/d917674ba0c744ac89230264c63b926b374b39c4\/header.jpg?t=1780680329","capsule_image